<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Wednesday 105,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Wednesday 105,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Wednesday's est receipts 105,000, Wk ago 90,000, and Yr ago 101,000 head. Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts sold $0.50 lower than mid-session Tuesday. Trade was moderate for light to moderate demnad and moderate offerings.</p>
<p>Top $56.50 per cwt.</p>
